Changed following Interfaces:


Changes at "/information" Interface:
- "/information"  renamed to "account"



Changes at "/social" Interface:
- "/submitComment"  renamed to "comments"
- "/submitAnswer"  renamed to "answers"
- "/submitCommentReport"  renamed to "/comments/report"
- "/submitAnswerReport"  renamed to "/answers/report"



